#: src/app/ui/streaming/hints.c:9
msgid ""
"Long press BACK (or press EXIT for traditional TV remote) while streaming, "
"to open status overlay."
msgstr "串流时长按 BACK（传统电视遥控器可按 EXIT）以打开状态浮层。"

#: src/app/ui/streaming/hints.c:10
msgid ""
"Hold Select/Back alone for 4 seconds during streaming to show or hide "
"performance stats."
msgstr "串流时仅按住 Select/Back 4 秒，即可显示或隐藏性能统计。"

#: src/app/ui/streaming/hints.c:11
msgid ""
"Xbox One/Series controller can't be directly connected via cable or official"
" adapter."
msgstr "Xbox One/Series 手柄无法通过线缆或官方适配器直接连接。"

#: src/app/ui/streaming/hints.c:13
msgid ""
"If you have ultra-wide monitor, you may need to change its resolution to fit"
" 16:9 for streaming."
msgstr "使用超宽屏显示器时，可能需要将分辨率调整为 16:9 才能串流。"

